{"id":"crema","lemma":"crema","pos":"noun","rank":1919,"glosses":["cream (cosmetic product)","cream (dairy product)","soup with cream"],"ipa":"/ˈkɾema/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cremas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-crema.wav","examples":[{"text":"Le pongo crema a mi café.","en":"I put some cream in my coffee.","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"orangutan"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"coffee"}]},{"text":"Café, por favor, con crema y azúcar.","en":"Coffee, please, with cream and sugar.","words":[{"g":"coffee"},null,null,{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"sugar"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"please"]]},{"text":"Hemos gastado toda la crema.","en":"We have run out of cream.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2538","words":[{"g":"heme","l":"hemo"},{"g":"worn out"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Añada un poco de azúcar y crema.","en":"Add a little sugar and cream.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606580","words":[{"g":"to augment","l":"añadir"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sugar"},{"g":"and"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"a bit"]]},{"text":"La manteca se hace con crema.","en":"Butter is made from cream.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590321","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"fat, lard"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"with"},null]}]}